  "gaps": [
    "The capture contains several programs (tail of a FlexPath BS in Health Care Administration program measured in program points, the BS in Health Care Administration, Leadership, and the Accelerated Master's Pathway BS in Health Care Administration/MHA Option, Leadership). This ledger covers only the standard GuidedPath BS in Health Care Administration, Leadership; confirm this is the intended program.",
    "Total requires a minimum of 54 quarter credits from the 3000-level and above; the capture does not specify how electives/general education must be chosen to satisfy this beyond the listed courses.",
    "No residency or institutional-credit (must be completed at Capella) requirement is stated in the capture; capstone is only stated as 'Taken during the student’s final quarter'.",
    "Optional Honors Pathway (PHI-H2005, COM-H4005, SOC-H3005; at least 15 quarter credits) is applied toward the general education requirement and is not listed as a separate requirement.",
    "Individual general education course selections are not fixed; only the 45-quarter-credit block with a minimum of 4 quarter credits from each category (Communication, Humanities, Natural Science and Mathematics, Social Science) is stated.",
    "Course prerequisites are referenced ('Refer to the course descriptions') but not included in the capture.",
    "Transfer credit limits and policies are not stated in the capture."
